EDreamUISdfSource.BitmapSingleChannel {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_DistanceField.h#EDreamUISdfSource:BitmapSingleChannel
    src   "Single-channel field derived from a rasterized bitmap (the original method). Corners round off."
    text  "从栅格化位图派生的单通道字段（原始方法）。角会变得圆钝。"
    state machine
