EDreamUISdfSource.OutlineMultiChannel {
    at    Source/DreamGUI/Public/Core/DreamUIFontData_DistanceField.h#EDreamUISdfSource:OutlineMultiChannel
    src   "Multi-channel field from the glyph outline (msdfgen): sharp corners from the median of three\nchannels, and a true distance in alpha that effects -- blur, glow, shadows, outlines -- widen into."
    text  "由字形轮廓（msdfgen）生成的多通道场：尖角取自三个通道的中值，alpha 通道中则是真实距离，\n模糊、发光、阴影、描边等效果可向外扩展。"
    state machine
}

EDreamUISmallTextCoverage {
